---
source: crates/pinmap-cli/tests/periph.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
SPI1  assigned in board/revb.pinasg.json  peripherals.SPI1
note  IMU bus; CS is a GPIO on PA4

SIGNAL  PIN  NET       MUX  CANDIDATES  CONFIG
SCK     PA5  IMU_SCK   AF5  PA5         speed=very_high
MISO    PA6  IMU_MISO  AF5  PA6         speed=very_high
MOSI    PA7  IMU_MOSI  AF5  PA7         speed=very_high
NSS     -    -         -    PA4         -

props
  spi-max-frequency = <8000000>
